    {
      "fileName": "beautiful-knifework.json",
      "id": "iUCz2engECjvbSeB",
      "name": "Beautiful Knifework",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "iUCz2engECjvbSeB",
        "folder": "rKTkNlqyaQuLy3sq",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Beautiful Knifework",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You perform surgical adjustments to disguise a willing ally or your construct companion. This counts as preparing a disguise to Impersonate, taking 10 minutes and requiring a healer's toolkit instead of a disguise kit. The DC to see through the deception with @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Seek] is your Medicine DC (@Check[perception|against:medicine|rollerRole:target|traits:secret|options:action:seek]) unless the disguised character's Deception DC is higher. If the target directly interacts with someone while disguised, they gain a +2 circumstance bonus to their Deception check.</p>\n<p>You can reverse this effect with another 10-minute surgery. The disguised character can also end it as a free action when they receive any healing effect.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 7
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Lepidstadt Surgeon Dedication"
              },
              {
                "value": "master in Medicine"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Rival Academies"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "subfeatures": {
            "proficiencies": {},
            "senses": {},
            "suppressedFeatures": []
          },
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "archetype",
              "exploration",
              "manipulate",
              "skill"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 7,
