    {
      "fileName": "let-my-creature-live.json",
      "id": "UgmLKNTU59Z3ETFc",
      "name": "Let My Creature Live!",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "UgmLKNTU59Z3ETFc",
        "folder": "rKTkNlqyaQuLy3sq",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Let My Creature Live!",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You continue to tinker with your creation's muscles and rudimentary mind, granting it a limited form of autonomy. Your construct companion becomes an advanced construct companion. During an encounter, even if you don't use the Command a Minion action, your construct companion can still use 1 action on your turn that round to Stride or Strike.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 6
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
